ewing-christian-college-cert-subject-specific-sec","name":"Subject Specific SEC (SSSEC)","level":"undergraduate","credential":"certificate/add-on","specialization":null,"duration":null,"mode":"regular","eligibility":"UG students taking admission in Ewing Christian College.","official_course_url":"https://www.ecc.ac.in/academics/certificate-courses/","verification_status":"verified_programme_family","career_path_mappings":[],"mapping_gap":"Subject-specific content varies by department; the official catalogue does not identify one single responsible career-tree discipline."}],"agent_notes":["Government listing was independently confirmed on the supplied 2025 NIRF College ranking page for Ewing Christian College in PRAYAGRAJ, Uttar Pradesh.","The official campus identity is confirmed by ecc.ac.in and its contact page at Gaughat, Prayagraj, Uttar Pradesh 211003.","The managed proxy produced the exact self-signed certificate-in-chain TLS error on the first normal curl attempt; curl --insecure was then used only for public GET requests to the expected official/search hostnames.","eccprayagraj.org is linked directly from the official ecc.ac.in admissions pages and was used as the official current admissions/prospectus domain.","The catalogue is marked partial/manual review because the 2026 admissions portal has active forms for UG, B.Ed., PG, and DLT while its PG diploma application links are commented out, even though the main ecc.ac.in catalogue still states that PGDCA, PGDHM, and PGDM are conducted.","The main Post Graduate Arts page lists English and Political Science, while the current 2026 prospectus additionally lists Mathematics for M.A.; the current prospectus lists M.Sc. subjects as Botany, Chemistry, Mathematics, and Zoology.","The official /academics/phd/ page labels the doctoral programme Ph.D., while the current 2026 prospectus refers to the research programme as D.Phil.; doctoral entries are retained from the explicit Ph.D. catalogue page and flagged for review.","The certificate page describes compulsory two-credit undergraduate add-on courses rather than standalone admission programmes; named current offerings were included, while the generic department-specific SEC pool remains unmapped.","No separate brochure was downloaded for individual programmes; one centrally linked official 2026-27 prospectus was used for current programme, duration, and eligibility verification."]}